    "en": {
      "trackName": "Lunar Lander Mini",
      "description": "Strap in and take control of your very own lunar lander — right on your Apple Watch! Navigate treacherous terrain, dodge obstacles, and master the art of precision landing. Every tap and twist of the Digital Crown puts you in control of your rocket’s thrust and angle — are you ready to defy gravity?\n\nIntuitive Watch Controls: Tap to thrust, twist the Digital Crown to steer.\n\nChallenging Terrain: Each level presents new hills, valleys, and hazards to test your skills.\n\nDynamic HUD: Track your speed, angle, and progress in real-time.\n\nQuick-Play Fun: Perfect for short bursts on the go — race against time and your own high scores.\n\nCan you land safely and beat your best? Experience the thrill of lunar exploration without leaving your wrist. Your mission awaits!",
